## Status

- The API is **unversioned**. Breaking changes ship without a path bump — pin
  nothing, read the changelog.
- `GET /api/health/` is the only unauthenticated endpoint. It is a liveness probe,
  not a status page: it reports that the process is up, not that the database is.
{{#if withS3}}
- File storage runs against MinIO locally and S3 in deployed environments. Presigned
  URL lifetimes differ between the two.
{{/if}}
- No webhooks, no rate limiting, and no API keys yet.
